Vietnam provincial names in this directory are a trimmed copy of the
Vietnamese Provinces Database:

  https://github.com/thanglequoc/vietnamese-provinces-database

Dataset version: v5.2.0
Latest decree in this snapshot: 388/NQ-UBTVQH16
Source file: json/simplified_json_generated_data_vn_units_minified.json

Only province suggestion fields are kept (code, name, nameEn, fullName).
Ward/commune data, GIS, and postal codes are omitted.

vietnam-provinces.js is the 34-province list used by the city picker.

